4
00:02:33.071 --> 00:02:35.031
Left or right?

5
00:02:38.368 --> 00:02:40.578
Left... I mean right.

6
00:02:41.579 --> 00:02:43.831
Left or right?

7
00:02:43.832 --> 00:02:45.499
Right.

8
00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.128
How many tranquillisers are you taking?

9
00:02:49.045 --> 00:02:51.672
