- You're working tomorrow?

216
00:29:08.248 --> 00:29:09.833
That's cool.

217
00:29:26.391 --> 00:29:29.977
- <i>Yes?</i>
- Hello. Home security, Vincent Loreau.

218
00:29:29.978 --> 00:29:31.855
- Come in.
- Thank you.

219
00:29:45.160 --> 00:29:47.954
